049", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86610709_1207881556901382_8261616038979495969_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=U1nKSTF07PYQ7kNvwEt_c6Q&_nc_oc=AdomjzYReRUxRDJ-3RgakBSeXfLzi8spZqqjKDc5MqR2MpLE-Qxkzlij-8afEZ7-zaY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQC6K4fAv5Fr49uC4DHCWuHVIc579faELEG1IA3Jj-To0g&oe=6A636E81"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Base X", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Base X: The Ultimate VR Batting Simulator\n\nElevate your batting practice with Base X, an immersive VR baseball simulator available on Meta Quest. Tailored for players of all skill levels, Base X offers a cutting-edge training experience designed to enhance your batting technique. Step into a virtual environment that replicates the feel of being on a real baseball field, and refine your swing with precision.\n\nBase X allows you to customize your training sessions by selecting the pitch location, ball movement, and pitch speed. This level of control ensures that you can create realistic and varied scenarios to challenge yourself and improve different aspects of your batting technique. Whether you're preparing for fastballs, curveballs, or sliders, Base X provides the flexibility to tailor your practice to your specific needs.\n\nA key feature of Base X is its comprehensive batting analytics. As you train, you'll receive detailed feedback on your performance, including insights into your swing mechanics and contact quality. This data-driven approach enables you to identify strengths and areas for improvement, helping you make informed adjustments to your technique.", "short_description": "A VR Baseball Simulator to improve Baseball Batting"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://xrevstudiopk.blogspot.com/2023/08/xrev-studio.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Xrev Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website